      "platforms": "PC", "ends": "2026-10-01" }
  ]
}</code></pre><h2>GET /api/games?title=\u2026</h2><p>Search games by title or Steam app ID. At least one of <code>title</code> / <code>steamAppID</code> is required. <code>limit</code> (max 60) and <code>exact</code> are optional. Pass <code>ids</code> (up to 25 comma-separated game IDs) instead to fetch several games at once.</p><pre><code>curl -H "X-API-Key: lr_your_key_here" \\
